Subject: [PATCH] liuqin 7.3.1: usb-pcs

10bddb42; retain 7.3 shared DP/USB initialization.
Original-Author: nadelacruz-00 <323917690+nadelacruz-00@users.noreply.github.com>
Upstream-commit: https://github.com/yzddmr6/linux-sm8450-liuqin/commit/10bddb4202c87dd395743467939c852fae46e93a
